灯谜。","label":"元宵节的日期、别称与习俗","note":"元宵节在农历正月十五，又称元夕、上元、灯节、元夜等。常见习俗包括赏花灯、闹年鼓和猜灯谜。","learningGoal":"说明元宵节的日期、别称和主要习俗。","productionMode":"reuse","productionLabel":"直接复用","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"daily-life-language","tabId":"festivals-memorials","sourceUnitIds":["cs-10-15-p19-festival-table"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=daily-life-language&tabId=festivals-memorials","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"pending-user-sampling","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"6f3d7ca9"}]